>
<h3><code><$text text=<<vocabField>>/></code> → <$text text={{{ [[Fields/]addsuffix<vocabField>addsuffix[/Prompt]] :map[function[base-fields-lingo-text],<currentTiddler>trim[:]trim[]] }}}/></h3>
